      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "65bd59fa3e337fbb400d0315",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently, group ownership is not transferable to another player.\n\nIf the owner leaves the group for some reason, but still wants the group to continue to exist, this cannot be accomplished.\n\nIt might be possible to start a new group, but the larger the group, the more difficult the transition to the new group will be.\n\nIf the owner could change another player to be the owner, this problem would be solved.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Ability to transfer group ownership to other player",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6388335d6000a07b72cd6759",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
